---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About – Gabriel Alisasis"
  description="Gabriel Alisasis's background, work history, selected projects, and the tools and platforms he works in day to day."
>
  <div class="page-top-spacer" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="sec-num">01</span>
        <div>
          <span class="sec-kicker">About</span>
          <h2>Operations built on systems, not firefighting.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="prose reveal">
          <p>I'm an Operations Support and Marketing Automation Specialist with hands-on experience managing CRM systems, workflow automation, backend operations, and customer support for U.S.-based businesses.</p>
          <p>My background is in <strong>GoHighLevel and Bubble</strong> – building the automations, funnels, and operational systems that improve efficiency, improve customer experience, and let a business scale without adding headcount. I hold a Computer Science degree focused on software development, which means I don't just configure CRMs – I understand what's happening under the hood.</p>
          <p>That matters more than it sounds. The two hardest problems I solved this year weren't in a workflow builder. One was a DMARC policy silently bouncing every marketing email a brand sent. The other was a healthcare platform that needed real role-based access enforced in the database, not hidden in the UI. <strong>I go as deep as the problem requires.</strong></p>
        </div>
        <div class="about-panel reveal">
          <div class="facts">
            <div><span class="idx mono">01</span><div><strong>GoHighLevel &amp; CRM</strong><span>Workflows, pipelines, forms, funnels, and automations built to convert and retain.</span></div></div>
            <div><span class="idx mono">02</span><div><strong>Operations management</strong><span>Daily process ownership – resolving issues before they become bottlenecks.</span></div></div>
            <div><span class="idx mono">03</span><div><strong>Technical fluency</strong><span>CS background in software development – React, Shopify Liquid, Supabase, and data.</span></div></div>
            <div><span class="idx mono">04</span><div><strong>Deliverability &amp; email</strong><span>Klaviyo flows, DNS authentication (SPF/DKIM/DMARC), and sender reputation.</span></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-panel-tags">
            <span class="bento-pill">Philippines · Remote</span>
            <span class="bento-pill">GMT+8 · US hours</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="sec-num">02</span>
        <div>
          <span class="sec-kicker">Experience</span>
          <h2>Work history</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="xp">
        <div class="reveal">
          <div>
            <span class="xp-when">Mar 2025 – Jun 2026</span>
            <span class="xp-where">LiveHowYouWantUSA<br>United States</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Operations Support Analyst</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Managed <strong>GoHighLevel CRM</strong>, workflows, forms, automations, and daily operational processes.</li>
              <li>Maintained Bubble backend workflows and customer data for seamless platform performance.</li>
              <li>Built and managed online communities that scaled from <strong>900 to 36,000+ members in 8 months</strong>.</li>
              <li>Resolved operational issues while improving customer experience and internal efficiency.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="site-preview">
              <div class="chrome">
                <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="urlbar">livehowyouwant.com</span>
              </div>
              <img class="zoomable site-shot" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1200" height="760" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                   alt="Live How You Want homepage – the CRM and community platform">
              <div class="site-body">
                <span>CRM &amp; community platform I helped run</span>
                <a class="visit-btn" href="https://livehowyouwant.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <div>
            <span class="xp-when">Oct 2024 – Aug 2025</span>
            <span class="xp-where">Supreme Club Tours<br>United States</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Marketing Automation Specialist</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Built GoHighLevel automations for lead capture, nurturing, and customer communication.</li>
              <li>Managed CRM operations supporting growth to <strong>3,000+ customers within 5 months</strong>.</li>
              <li>Managed partnerships with brands including Insomniac, supporting audience growth and bookings.</li>
              <li>Designed marketing assets and promotional materials for Las Vegas nightlife campaigns.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="site-preview">
              <div class="chrome">
                <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="urlbar">supremeclubtours.com</span>
              </div>
              <img class="zoomable site-shot" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1200" height="675" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                   alt="Supreme Club Tours homepage – Las Vegas nightlife and events booking site">
              <div class="site-body">
                <span>Las Vegas nightlife &amp; events site I supported</span>
                <a class="visit-btn" href="https://supremeclubtours.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal">
          <div>
            <span class="xp-when">Apr 2023 – Sep 2023</span>
            <span class="xp-where">BSU STEER HUB<br>Philippines</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Front-End Developer</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>Developed and tested real-time web application features.</li>
              <li>Improved user interface functionality and usability.</li>
              <li>Maintained responsive front-end components and system performance.</li>
              <li>Used performance analytics to optimize content strategy and engagement.</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="site-preview">
              <div class="chrome">
                <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
                <span class="urlbar">steerhub.batstateu.edu.ph</span>
              </div>
              <img class="zoomable site-shot" src="data:image/webp;base64," width="1200" height="676" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                   alt="BSU STEER HUB homepage – the university web application I helped develop">
              <div class="site-body">
                <span>University web app I helped develop</span>
                <a class="visit-btn" href="https://steerhub.batstateu.edu.ph" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit ↗</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="sec-num">03</span>
        <div>
          <span class="sec-kicker">Selected projects</span>
          <h2>Things I've built</h2>
          <p>Filter by discipline – the mix runs from CRM automation through to machine learning.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="filter-bar reveal" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects by discipline">
        <button class="chip" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All <span class="count">4</span></button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="automation" aria-pressed="false">Automation <span class="count">1</span></button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="fullstack" aria-pressed="false">Full-stack <span class="count">2</span></button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="frontend" aria-pressed="false">Front-end <span class="count">2</span></button>
        <button class="chip" data-filter="data" aria-pressed="false">Data &amp; AI <span class="count">2</span></button>
      </div>
      <p class="filter-status" id="filterStatus" role="status">Showing all 4 projects</p>

      <div class="projects" id="projectsGrid">
        <div class="project-card reveal" data-tags="automation">
          <span class="p-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Experience Vegas</h3>
            <span class="loc">Destination ticketing platform · USA</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Developed workflow automations that streamlined customer journeys.</li>
              <li>Managed weekly event listings and promotional content for Las Vegas events.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">GoHighLevel</span><span class="tag">Zapier</span><span class="tag">Ops</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card reveal" data-tags="fullstack data frontend">
          <span class="p-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Vision Drive</h3>
            <span class="loc">AI intelligent transport system · Philippines</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Built real-time analytics dashboards using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Firebase, and Chart.js.</li>
              <li>Developed live vehicle classification and traffic monitoring visualizations.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">JavaScript</span><span class="tag">Firebase</span><span class="tag">Chart.js</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card reveal" data-tags="data">
          <span class="p-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Hybrid Fraud Detection System</h3>
            <span class="loc">Capstone project · Philippines</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Developed a fraud detection framework using Python, statistical anomaly detection, and machine learning.</li>
              <li>Applied Z-score analysis and Benford's Law to flag suspicious patterns in insurance claim data.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">ML</span><span class="tag">Statistics</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="project-card reveal" data-tags="fullstack frontend">
          <span class="p-num">04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>University Public Dashboard</h3>
            <span class="loc">Research portal · Philippines</span>
            <ul>
              <li>Built a centralized research portal using Next.js, React.js, Node.js, and Tailwind CSS.</li>
              <li>Integrated APIs and advanced search for improved research accessibility.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Next.js</span><span class="tag">React</span><span class="tag">Node.js</span><span class="tag">Tailwind</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="skills">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="sec-num">04</span>
        <div>
          <span class="sec-kicker">Stack</span>
          <h2>The tools, and where they were used</h2>
          <p>Every mark below points at a real engagement, not a list of things I've heard of.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="matrix-wrap reveal">
        <table class="matrix">
          <caption class="sr-only">Which tools were used on which client engagement</caption>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th scope="col">Tool</th>
              <th scope="col">Cordelia ARC</th>
              <th scope="col">Kemp Beauty</th>
              <th scope="col">Sell Ready AI</th>
              <th scope="col">Orange Ashes</th>
              <th scope="col">LiveHowYouWant</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><th scope="row">GoHighLevel</th>
              <td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Klaviyo</th>
              <td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Shopify Liquid</th>
              <td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">React / TypeScript</th>
              <td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Supabase / Postgres</th>
              <td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">HTML / CSS / JS</th>
              <td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">DNS / DKIM / DMARC</th>
              <td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Zapier</th>
              <td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td></tr>
            <tr><th scope="row">Git</th>
              <td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-yes">■</td><td class="cell-no">·</td><td class="cell-no">·</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-grid">
        <div class="skill-group reveal">
          <h4>Development</h4>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">React</span><span class="pill">TypeScript</span><span class="pill">Next.js</span>
            <span class="pill">JavaScript</span><span class="pill">Tailwind CSS</span><span class="pill">HTML / CSS</span>
            <span class="pill">Shopify Liquid</span><span class="pill">Supabase</span><span class="pill">Postgres</span>
            <span class="pill">Python</span><span class="pill">SQL</span><span class="pill">Git</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-group reveal">
          <h4>CRM &amp; marketing platforms</h4>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">GoHighLevel</span><span class="pill">Klaviyo</span><span class="pill">Zapier</span>
            <span class="pill">HubSpot CRM</span><span class="pill">Salesforce CRM</span><span class="pill">Kommo</span>
            <span class="pill">Shopify</span><span class="pill">WordPress</span><span class="pill">Meta Business Suite</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-group reveal">
          <h4>Operations &amp; analytics</h4>
          <div class="pill-row">
            <span class="pill">ClickUp</span><span class="pill">Monday.com</span><span class="pill">Trello</span>
            <span class="pill">Google Sheets</span><span class="pill">Microsoft Excel</span>
            <span class="pill">ChatGPT</span><span class="pill">Claude</span><span class="pill">Midjourney</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="education">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="sec-num">05</span>
        <div>
          <span class="sec-kicker">Education</span>
          <h2>Background</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="edu-card reveal">
        <div>
          <h3>BSc Computer Science – Software Development</h3>
          <p>Batangas State University, Alangilan Campus · Batangas City, Philippines</p>
        </div>
        <span class="edu-date mono">Aug 2021 – Jul 2025</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
